      {
        "Id": "9e2266c9274158d87c2b137162feb3f4",
        "Title": "Describe the field",
        "DescriptionText": "Comparisons are type-aware, so a field that holds \"50\" as text still compares as fifty. Strictly above: at exactly 25 this one is false, and Condition.AtLeast is the version that is not.",
